# .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Use:  git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Add the SHA of commits that should be ignored by `git blame`.
# Typical candidates: bulk-format commits, rename commits, import commits.
#
# Format: one SHA per line. Lines starting with `#` are ignored.
#
# Example (once a "format codebase" commit lands in a follow-up PR):
# a1b2c3d4e5f67890... chore: format codebase with prettier